@startuml
title 27A. Compensation Planning - Review Cycle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #546E7A
  ArrowColor #607D8B
  DiamondBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
  DiamondBorderColor #546E7A
}
skinparam partition {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #90A4AE
}
|HR / Compensation Admin|
start
:Create compensation cycle;
:Set budget, eligibility,
and review guidelines;

|System|
:Load employee compensation data;
:Allocate manager budgets;

|Manager|
:Review employee performance and pay;
:Propose salary adjustments;

|System|
:Validate budget and policy limits;
if (Outside limits?) then (Yes)
  :Flag exception;
  |Manager|
  :Revise proposal or add justification;
endif

|HR / Compensation Admin|
:Review submitted proposals;
stop
@enduml
